    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Celce Celce",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101730635250211786258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIghF4iPA63WwaOiJKIDCzi5m0kQhTWjpovH8F-On2-5zHB4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Wonderful place everything is so yummmii!\nAnd the waitress are so so nice you always feel welcome and well serve with the right recommendations.\nI m there every Friday with some friends it s become a new sweet spot.",
        "time": 1764970131,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolas G.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103521018403691589419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuZffi_dzOxrectJ9i_QSWeHFW3YJMf43qPD25n1V50PCBXZRa=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I can’t say enough good things about this bakery. From the moment you walk in, you’re greeted by the comforting smell of fresh bread and pastries, and an atmosphere that feels genuinely welcoming. It’s the kind of place where you immediately sense care and craftsmanship behind everything they do.\n\nThe quality of the baked goods is outstanding. Everything tastes fresh, balanced, and thoughtfully made — not overly sweet, not heavy, just perfectly executed. Whether it’s their breads, pastries, or desserts, each item feels like it was baked with real attention to detail. You can tell they use good ingredients and take pride in their work.\n\nThe staff deserve special mention as well. Everyone is friendly, patient, and happy to make recommendations, which makes the experience even better. It never feels rushed, even when the place is busy, and that goes a long way in making customers feel appreciated.\n\nWhat really sets this bakery apart is consistency. Every visit delivers the same high quality, which is rare and impressive. It’s become one of those places I actively look forward to visiting and happily recommend to friends and family.\n\nIf you appreciate excellent baking, great service, and a cozy, authentic atmosphere, this bakery is absolutely worth a visit.",
        "time": 1766793568,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Enjoyed the bread—soft and chewy inside, crispy outside. Nice selections and well-organized sections. They divide the pies, croissants, pizzas, pastries, and drinks clearly. Plenty of staff with very friendly service. Lots of seating available in a clean and pleasant area.",
        "time": 1747353953,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lo Valentine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111796569160659196902/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIT6-2fp4xTxJ6ierJ9uFTiIKN3lpff7WUMSyxc-_esHZ9ZnHo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I am a long-time, regular customer who shops at this location at least twice a week. I have always had positive experiences with the staff, who are consistently professional and courteous. Unfortunately, that changed when we were served by the Assistant Manager for the first time. Her behavior was shockingly rude, dismissive, and completely unprofessional. This level of conduct is unacceptable, especially from someone in a management position. If this behavior is tolerated or continues, you should expect to lose loyal customers like myself.",
        "time": 1769112373,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dana Al Rifai",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112751923448436869408/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPBL_5YcG71oNg6TJYtpiCH78uP8yAnak2V_do6UW-CdmNbJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
